      "instance_name": "tanning_joke",
      "label": "Tanning Joke",
      "description": "A type of racial stereotype joke that uses the idea of tanning (sun exposure) to deflect from discussions about race or racial bias. It implies that a person’s skin color might be due to sunbathing rather than their racial background, which can be offensive and reductive.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
